  << /ActualText (Collaborated with product and project teams in designing and developing digital solutions based on business and operational needs\056 Responsible for conducting research\054 designing user experiences\054 and implementing designs across various enterprise systems\056\nResponsibilities \046 Achievements\072\nCollaborated with Business Analysts to design system flows aligned with business requirements and project objectives\056\nConducted user needs research and requirement analysis\054 including data requirements and dashboard design\056\nDeveloped interactive prototypes to support concept validation and design simulation before the development stage\056\nContributed to the development and improvement of the design system to enhance consistency and efficiency in the design process\056\nWorked cross\055functionally with Business Analysts and Developers to ensure design implementation met specifications and user needs\056\nInvolved in designing user flows and interfaces for the digitalization and development of several enterprise solutions\054 including\072\nGate Pass Management System \023 PT Panasonic Industrial Devices\nDaily Management System \050DMS\051 \023 PT Zekindo Kiatama Indonesia \046 PT Sumber Mas Autorindo\nManufacturing Execution System \050MES\051 \046 DMS \023 PT Electra Mobilitas Indonesia \050ALVA\051\nComputerized Maintenance Management System \050CMMS\051 \023 PT Paragon Technology and Innovation\nProblem Reporting \046 Tracking System \050PRTS\051 \023 PT Sumber Mas Autorindo)
