  << /ActualText (Experienced in designing and developing user interfaces for digital systems in the banking sector\056 Collaborated with cross\055functional teams to ensure the resulting designs aligned with business needs\054 usability standards\054 and end\055user requirements\056\nResponsibilities \046 Achievements\072\nContributed to the development of a design system using the Atomic Design approach to improve interface consistency and scalability\056\nCollaborated with Business Analysts to validate system requirements and refine concepts before the UI design process began\056\nCreated wireframes and user flow structures as an initial design phase to minimize revisions during development\056\nDesigned interfaces focused on usability and user process efficiency within digital banking applications\056\nInvolved in several banking projects\054 including\072\nBTN Internet Banking Business Portal\nBTN Internet Banking Business\nBTN Property Mobile\nBTN Mobile Banking)
